error[SC0523]: a const expression is not a type
 --> tests/ui/types/const_where_type_expected.science:8:16
  |
8 | def area(side: 4) -> Int:
  |                ^ this is a const expression, which denotes a value
  |
  = note: const expressions are generic arguments — the `4` of `Window of (Int, 4)` — so one belongs inside an `of (..)` list and nowhere else
